{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1613.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"302802b3f0019f6e6f80f57b7cc14f6b2b7afde2ffef3c15b71bf65905c8d05a","ja":"ジュリアの上目遣い、照れてぎこちない感じが\n逆にすごくかわいくなってきたかも。","zh":"茱莉亚向上仰望的眼神，害羞又生硬的感觉\n反而可能变得非常可爱了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1613.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"aaf0ef98b223ffb013be2312bbc85e3a0e6346e1f382c6a472ca4328bd1cccee","ja":"そ、そうか？　もっと堂々とできたらいいんだけど\n……まあ、いいか。他にもいろいろ試してみようぜ。","zh":"是、是吗？要是能再堂堂正正一点就好了……\n不过也行吧。再多试试其他各种方法吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
